`{{ language }}` without seeing you again. The effect is rendered headless by the harness at the
plan's resolution and judged on frames sampled at t = 0, 1, 2.5, 4 and 6 s (plus a preview GIF).

LANGUAGE CONTRACT THE BUILDER WILL FOLLOW (your plan must fit it — e.g. a fragment shader has no
